body:
`open_dynamic_library` has `ERR_FAIL_COND_V(!FileAccess::exists(path), ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND);`, so it will print unnecessary errors, probably better to add a silent return for `xcframeworks`, or directly fallback to loading static lib.

Might also worth adding few extra file path checks for xcframework with dylibs (exporter should convert these to frameworks, but won't hurt to have it just ion case it's added manually after project export or by editor plugin).

